{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":564,"digest":"sha256:d0fb1c2f3d0ed81925539b6d91c8400865cca9ffb749adf3183c6beeb58e6d17","download_count":10,"created_at":"2026-10-11T02:06:26Z","updated_at":"2026-10-11T02:06:26Z"}],"body":"本版加入 Linux 的 rpm 安装包、MCP 工具定义固定与变更扣留、闲置会话自动归档、硬件加速开关和反馈回复通知，并修复信任库无限增长、新会话默认模型被跳过时无提示等问题。\n\n## 新增\n\n- 新增 Linux 的 `.rpm` 安装包（`ReasonixStudio-linux-*.rpm`），本版是首个含 rpm 的版本；用 minisign 校验，无 GPG 签名；rpm 安装的版本暂不自动更新 (#12608)\n- MCP 工具定义在你批准时被固定：之后有变化或新增的工具会被扣住，不进入模型请求，调用会被明确拒绝，直到用 `reasonix mcp trust <名称> --digest <摘要>` 批准；桌面端目前只显示通知 (#12597)\n- 设置的外观页新增「图形」：可关闭硬件加速（下次启动生效），并显示当前窗口的绘制方式；窗口无法绘制时，可用环境变量 `REASONIX_DISABLE_GPU=1` 或参数 `--disable-gpu` 仅关闭这一次 (#12451)\n- 设置新增可选的闲置会话自动归档（默认关闭，默认 30 天，范围 1 到 3650）；已置顶、正在运行、有待回答事项或有未读完成的会话不会被归档，归档可恢复 (#11535)\n- 反馈的未读角标在应用打开期间自动刷新，窗口不在前台时有新回复会弹出通知；通知设置里新增「反馈有回复时」开关，在总开关打开时默认开启 (#11538)\n- 设置的「关于」页新增「支持项目」入口，含 PayPal 链接以及默认折叠的微信、支付宝收款码 (#11709)\n\n## 变更\n\n- 提交接口 `POST /submit` 只在提交确实被丢弃时返回 409；已受理并立刻结束的回合、排在结束中回合之后的提交现在返回 202 (#12596)\n- 电脑操作返回给模型的应用名和窗口标题现在限长并转义，包含换行或不可见字符的名称不再能伪造快照行 (#12585)\n- 安装 skill 或本地插件时，复制的来源若是指向目录的别名现在可以安装；批准之后来源别名被改指向别处，会被拒绝而不会复制 (#12112 by @KHG420)\n\n## 修复\n\n- 信任库 `trusted/` 目录不再无限增长：密封记录不再把合同的验收条目复制进每一回合，义务清单改为只存一份并按摘要引用 (#12609, Fixes #12603 fixed in #12609)\n- 新会话的默认模型是决策来源而被跳过时，终端界面和 `reasonix run` 现在给出「默认模型不可用」的通知，不再静默改用别的模型 (#12605 by @xxoingr)\n\n## 贡献者\n\n感谢本版本的贡献者：@KHG420、@xxoingr\n\n## What's Changed\n* test(serve): wait for a trace turn to go silent, not for a fixed time by @esengine in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/12599\n* fix(repolint): wire-parity reads embedded structs and extends, declares PermissionRules by @esengine in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/12590\n* perf(gitcmd): skip the driver listing for subcommands that cannot run a driver by @esengine in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/12588\n* fix(computer): bound and escape application names in the snapshot and app list by @esengine in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/12585\n* fix(serve): judge POST /submit by what admission did with it by @esengine in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/12596\n* feat(studio): opt-in archiving of conversations inactive for N days by @esengine in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/11535\n* fix(config): report a skipped default on the new-session path too by @xxoingr in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/12605\n* feat(studio): switch hardware acceleration off and show how the window is drawn by @esengine in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/12451\n* feat(release): build and publish an rpm of Studio for Linux by @esengine in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/12608\n* feat(feedback): refresh the unread badge while open and announce new replies by @esengine in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/11538\n* feat(studio): add a Support entry to Settings > About by @esengine in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/11709\n* fix(installsource): copy directory root aliases by @KHG420 in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/12112\n* fix(agent): stop copying the contract's criteria into every sealed bundle by @esengine in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/12609\n* feat(plugin): pin MCP tool definitions at approval and hold changed tools by @esengine in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/12597\n* docs(release): Studio 2.35.0 notes by @esengine in https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/pull/12610\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/esengine/DeepSeek-Reasonix/compare/studio-v2.34.0...studio-v2.35.0\n\n\n---\n\n**macOS** 已用 Developer ID 签名并公证，打开时不需要清除隔离属性。**Windows** 的窗口、内核与安装器都经 Certum 代码签名证书做了 Authenticode 签名。**Linux** Debian 系从 `.deb` 安装，Fedora、RHEL、openSUSE 等从 `.rpm` 安装（`sudo dnf install ./ReasonixStudio-linux-amd64.rpm`）。\n\n三个平台都能自更新：Linux 的 `.deb` 走自己的包（`.rpm` 的自更新尚未提供，请手动下载新包），Windows 运行下一个安装器，macOS 替换自身 bundle。\n","mentions_count":3}
